<div class="yi-stack">
<h4 class="yi-heading yi-heading--xl">Deploying with <code class="yi-inline-code">nomad</code>
</h4>
<p class="yi-text">Run <code class="yi-inline-code">nomad job run caddy.hcl</code> to deploy, then check <code class="yi-inline-code">/v1/status</code> until it reports <code class="yi-inline-code">healthy</code>.</p>
<p class="yi-text yi-text--sm yi-text--muted">Set <code class="yi-inline-code">NOMAD_ADDR</code> first.</p>
</div>
